Subject: [PATCH 2/7] fix(conversation): end the prompt row with its mode tag,
 at the bubble's edge

The hover-only time and actions came after the Plan/Deep research tag in the
row under a prompt. Hidden with opacity they still took their width, so on a
pointer screen the tag sat about 125 px left of the bubble's right edge
(measured on develop 2026-11-19). They now come first in the row, so the tag
ends it and the actions appear to its left on hover; DOM and focus order match
what is shown.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BHQAws7LSR8fWEJvjbJM4q
